    19	| `BASELINE -> ADDITIVE_ONLY` | **+10.80%** |
    20	| `ADDITIVE_ONLY -> WITH_RESIDUAL` | **+5.62%** |
    21	| **`BASELINE -> WITH_RESIDUAL`** | **+17.03%** |
