    32	
    33	An “evaluation” below is one **complete configuration at one physical boundary**, the unit incremented by `EvaluationCounter.boundary_evaluations` (`run_v025_matrix_probe.py:793-901,1028-1032`). It is not a focal-user gain lookup.
