    11	Every accepted searched setting preserved at least the declared credited spectral efficiency for every active transmission slot. This is stronger than the unchanged service guard: served count therefore stayed at 100/100 on each anchor, and rate-target attainment increased from 72 to 100 users on anchor 0 and from 70 to 100 on anchor 1.
