    19	The improvement came primarily from more productive mode choices rather than energy reduction. Pooled integrated bits increased **115.265%**, while joules increased **0.868%**. Per anchor, the changes were +118.873% bits / +1.509% joules at step 0 and +111.626% bits / +0.258% joules at step 1.
